Build two features for the Zip Code Checker app at /Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Shopify App/Zip-Code.

---

## FEATURE A: Show Cutoff Time + Delivery Days in Storefront Widget (Tier 1.1)

This data is ALREADY stored in `DeliveryRule` (fields: `cutoffTime`, `daysOfWeek`) but never shown to customers. Zero DB changes needed.

### Step 1: Read these files completely
1. `app/routes/api.zip-check.tsx` — understand the full response and how DeliveryRule is queried
2. `extensions/zip-code-widget/blocks/zip-code-checker.liquid` — understand JS/CSS structure
3. `app/routes/app.widget.tsx` — find the DEFAULTS and feature toggles (showEta, showZone, etc.)
4. `prisma/schema.prisma` — check if WidgetConfig has showCutoffTime / showDeliveryDays fields

### Step 2: Update api.zip-check.tsx

After finding the matching DeliveryRule (it should already be queried for `estimatedDays`, `deliveryFee` etc.), also include `cutoffTime` and `daysOfWeek` in the API response. 

If no DeliveryRule query exists yet, add one after the ZipCode lookup:
```typescript
// Find matching delivery rule for this zip/zone
const deliveryRule = await db.deliveryRule.findFirst({
  where: {
    shop,
    isActive: true,
    OR: [
      { zipCodes: { contains: normalizedZip } },
      { zone: zipCode.zone ?? undefined, zipCodes: null },
    ],
  },
  orderBy: { priority: "asc" },
  select: { cutoffTime: true, daysOfWeek: true, estimatedDays: true },
});
```

Include in response:
```typescript
cutoffTime: deliveryRule?.cutoffTime ?? null,
daysOfWeek: deliveryRule?.daysOfWeek ?? null,
```

### Step 3: Update the Liquid widget

In the JavaScript section (inside the result rendering logic), after displaying ETA/zone, add:

```javascript
// Cutoff time display
if (result.cutoffTime) {
  const ctEl = document.createElement('div');
  ctEl.className = 'zcc-cutoff';
  // Format "14:00" → "2:00 PM"
  var parts = result.cutoffTime.split(':');
  var h = parseInt(parts[0], 10);
  var m = parts[1] || '00';
  var ampm = h >= 12 ? 'PM' : 'AM';
  h = h % 12 || 12;
  ctEl.textContent = '⏰ Order by ' + h + ':' + m + ' ' + ampm + ' for same-day delivery';
  resultContainer.appendChild(ctEl);
}

// Delivery days display
if (result.daysOfWeek) {
  const ddEl = document.createElement('div');
  ddEl.className = 'zcc-delivery-days';
  ddEl.textContent = '📅 Delivers: ' + result.daysOfWeek;
  resultContainer.appendChild(ddEl);
}
```

Add CSS:
```css
.zcc-cutoff { margin-top: 4px; font-size: 0.85em; color: #6d7175; }
.zcc-delivery-days { margin-top: 4px; font-size: 0.85em; color: #6d7175; }
```

